        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 04 \u2014 Seedance 2.5 Image-to-Video\n\nTurns one approved final still into a short realistic video clip using ByteDance's Seedance 2.5 (Reference-to-Video mode, task_type=`reference`), with the still as the primary reference image. Optionally add 1-2 more canonical identity photos as extra references to further lock identity/clothing/environment across the clip.\n\n**Configurable per the current Seedance 2.5 API**: resolution (up to 1080p; 4k is a Seedance 2.0-only option), duration (up to 30s on 2.5), aspect ratio ('adaptive' keeps the still's own framing). Switch the model dropdown to Seedance 2.0/Fast/Mini for other quality/cost/resolution tradeoffs (see the node's tooltip and price badge).\n\nEdit the motion prompt below the default one \u2014 keep instructions subtle and physically plausible; large/fast motion is where identity and anatomy tend to drift."
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
